A simple nested loop.

This script counts from 1 to 3 three times. The inner counter j is set back to
3 at the start of every outer iteration. The numbers are pushed onto the mixing
bowl while counting down (3, 2, 1), but a baking dish is served from the top,
so they come out in reverse order. The expected output is:
123
123
123

Ingredients.
3 i
3 j
3 three
10 ml newline

Method.
Count the i.
Put newline into mixing bowl.
Put three into mixing bowl.
Fold j into mixing bowl.
Scan the j.
Put j into mixing bowl.
Decrement the j until scanned.
Decrement the i until counted.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.

Serves 1.
